es reduce hallucinations by 27% versus prose summaries (paired t-test, p=0.107, n=12). The planner achieves 98.8% valid-DAG rate across 300 planning calls. In production at Brevian.ai, BatchDAG processes queries over 50,000+ meetings in under 60 seconds, with measured per-query costs of $0.02-$0.24 at published GPT-5.1 pricing.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4RFkZepw81zp5aBoNkHjVIodlSkF4q3WKDpGZ1gGjO0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxXBatchDAG: LLM-Planned Execution Graphs for Scalable Ad-Hoc Analysis Over Enterprise Dataƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;o1cH57vqKs0KxxBtbX-mU8Su7ZFA6u0TLQ6ewkxUU1Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2tO2DaucB13DvSEV5SQJXvZOH1rIKMosKFfdrqDbeLMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18241ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nTfKBHgw8GnWsVloEuKIbHxcGj64F1u-QZo0NqNeT0wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWbatchdag-llm-planned-execution-graphs-for-scalable-ad-hoc-analysis-over-enterprise-dataƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4yCdzZYtBVCEv69WsQosOUxiSUyV6ey_vpx2yRwSPAIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QUm2MUVxotwtje9VUMA04APnyovQ26rO8eLhRxm8LtEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FbmPEM-tFHhtmGPKfFymBKcktgonITphGG7URUWci0wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;Op-beqcn-j34tPYrZj9